---
title: "P.R.O.T.E.C.T. control block diagram (refined)"
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 300
    nodeSpacing: 40
    rankSpacing: 50
    padding: 8
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 17px
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph SENSE["SENSING  ·  one cycle every 2 s"]
    MAX["MAX30102 · 0x57 · I2C<br/>heart rate + SpO2 (PPG)"]
    MPU["MPU6050 · 0x69 · I2C<br/>fall: spike above 2 g, then stillness"]
    RTC["DS3231 · 0x68 · I2C<br/>timestamp, set from NTP"]
    BTN["SOS button · GPIO4 to GND<br/>falling-edge interrupt"]
    NTP["NTP time source · UTC+8"]
    TEMP["DS18B20 · GPIO4 · 1-Wire<br/>disconnected at evaluation;<br/>MCP9808 (I2C 0x18) selected"]
  end

  ESP["<b>ESP32 DevKit</b> · main controller<br/>acquisition + EMA filtering<br/>Maxim HR / SpO2 computation<br/>threshold evaluation of every parameter<br/>fall rule · status word · time stamp · cloud payload"]

  MAX --> ESP
  MPU --> ESP
  RTC --> ESP
  BTN --> ESP
  NTP --> ESP
  TEMP -.-> ESP

  subgraph LOCAL["LOCAL OUTPUTS  ·  one event, four consistent notifications"]
    WORD["Status word<br/>FEELING WELL · CHECK NEEDED<br/>ALERT · MEASURING · SOS-HELP"]
    BUZZ["Piezo buzzer · GPIO27<br/>10 s per alarm"]
    SMS["SIM900A GSM · UART · own 5 V rail<br/>SMS to up to 3 caregivers"]
  end

  ESP --> WORD
  ESP --> BUZZ
  ESP --> SMS

  subgraph CLOUD["CLOUD AND WEBSITE"]
    WIFI["Wi-Fi · HTTPS<br/>snapshot every 2 s · history every 30 s"]
    RTDB[("Firebase Realtime Database<br/>/PROTECT/sensors · /PROTECT/history<br/>/PROTECT/devices/&#123;id&#125; — planned")]
    RELAY["Server-side relay (api/)<br/>site aggregation<br/>session + role checks"]
    PUB["Public fleet view<br/>sites, unit counts, status<br/>no readings, no unit codes"]
    OPS["Operator dashboard<br/>one unit's readings and history<br/>signed-in caregiver only"]
  end

  ESP --> WIFI --> RTDB --> RELAY
  RELAY --> PUB
  RELAY --> OPS

  subgraph PWR["POWER"]
    AC["220 V AC mains"] --> PS["5 V DC supply"]
    PS --> BUCK["Buck converter<br/>3.3 V for ESP32 and sensors"]
    PS --> SIMP["Separate 5 V / 2 A rail for the GSM module<br/>1000 uF bulk capacitor"]
  end

  BUCK --> ESP
  SIMP --> SMS

  NOTE["<b>State at the time of evaluation</b><br/>The MAX30102 was not responding and<br/>the DS18B20 probe was disconnected,<br/>so the heart rate, SpO2 and temperature<br/>displayed by the firmware were simulated.<br/>The input pin freed by the probe carried<br/>the SOS button.<br/>The 3.5-inch TFT was parked, the LED<br/>indicators were removed, and the microSD<br/>card was not part of the delivered unit —<br/>readings are logged in the cloud.<br/>The device is audible and status-word only:<br/>the word, the buzzer and the SMS carry<br/>the alert."]

  ESP -.-> NOTE

  classDef planned fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:1px
  classDef note fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b,stroke-dasharray: 4 3
  class TEMP planned
  class NOTE note
